WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
And that's treasonous, probably.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.480
So if you could, if you, very important,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.280
if you could do that, it would be great.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.560
Nobody would know better than you.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.160
You'll figure it out.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:12.720
Thank you.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.200
Please, go ahead.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.720
Yeah, my name's Nick Shirley.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:16.840
I'm 23 years old.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.639
I'm 100% independent YouTube journalist.

00:00:19.639 --> 00:00:21.040
And over the past year or so, I've

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.000
been able to go to 15 countries.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.360
I've hung out with people in the gangs of Brazil

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.400
in the favelas, in the prisons of Central.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.360
But yet, the most dangerous places I have been

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.480
have been here in the United States, unfortunately.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.720
And I've had the opportunity to show people about the protest

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.160
antifa here in the United States.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:39.720
And there's nothing organic about what they are doing here

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:40.759
in the United States.

00:00:40.759 --> 00:00:43.200
I've watched people be bused in from states.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.919
I've watched the same lady at a protest in Atlanta

00:00:46.919 --> 00:00:51.000
be bused to protest in DC, and then in New York City.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.119
There's nothing that is honest about what they are doing.

00:00:55.119 --> 00:00:55.919
And they have signs.

00:00:55.919 --> 00:00:59.880
I've seen the same signs here in DC and in London as well.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:03.040
It's a big organization, incorporation

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.760
that they're running.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:07.120
And people may wonder, what's the threat to us

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.360
as Americans if we go?

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.919
Well, you'll be labeled as a fascist.

00:01:09.919 --> 00:01:11.360
You'll be labeled as a Nazi.

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:13.279
And they'll wish death upon you, because they

00:01:13.279 --> 00:01:14.040
wish death upon me.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.440
And just last week in Portland, Oregon,

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:20.080
I watched a lady get trapped in her car, surrounded by antifa.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.279
And her sister messaged me after seeing the video.

00:01:22.279 --> 00:01:24.480
She said, the only reason I think my sister was safe

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.320
was because you were there recording me.

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:30.959
I also was chased out by a member of antifa

00:01:30.959 --> 00:01:33.320
who said he would smoke me.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:37.279
And next thing he knew, a DHS sniper had lasers on his chest.

00:01:37.279 --> 00:01:38.760
If he was not there, who knows what

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.919
would have happened that day?

00:01:40.919 --> 00:01:42.239
These people are very dangerous.

00:01:42.239 --> 00:01:46.040
And people wonder how they're able to do it.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.040
The reason is because these cities are not

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.320
enforcing the law.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.959
And why should these people be worried if the law is not

00:01:51.959 --> 00:01:53.720
being enforced?

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:57.279
And we are not far right, nor are we far wrong.

00:01:57.279 --> 00:01:58.440
We're just right.

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:00.559
And the truth about what's happening here in America

00:02:00.559 --> 00:02:02.639
with these groups is very dangerous.

00:02:02.639 --> 00:02:04.919
And I thank you, Mr. President, and your administration

00:02:04.919 --> 00:02:06.599
as well for acknowledging that.

00:02:06.599 --> 00:02:08.399
Thank you very much.

00:02:08.399 --> 00:02:10.039
It's too bad you have to go through it.

00:02:10.039 --> 00:02:10.539
I know.

00:02:10.539 --> 00:02:12.199
It's a little crazy, right, Mr. President?

00:02:12.199 --> 00:02:13.839
When you're going to get to the bottom of it.

00:02:13.839 --> 00:02:15.699
So it's a very important thing you're doing.

00:02:15.699 --> 00:02:16.559
Thank you very much.

00:02:16.559 --> 00:02:17.839
Please, Kim.

00:02:17.839 --> 00:02:20.520
Yeah, I've just got something very short.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:23.199
I'm attacked every time I do my job.

00:02:23.199 --> 00:02:26.279
When I leave my house to go to work, I am violently assaulted.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.479
I've had guns pulled on me.

00:02:27.479 --> 00:02:28.600
I've been bear sprayed.

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:29.720
I've been beaten down.

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:31.240
I've been almost killed.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:35.360
So my question for all of you is, how would you feel?

